Pi-DOS: Remove unused and redundant bundled DOS utilities.

Drop the fifteen selected commands from Z:. Exclude standalone binary
payloads from libbuiltin and compile out EDLIN/COMP in their shared
EDIT/FC source files. Keep PC-98 CWSDPMI registration independent.

